        "essence_text": "A luminous inner-world adventure that makes feelings feel like characters you can root for, then quietly breaks your heart in the gentlest way. Watching it is like being given permission to be sad and still okay, wrapped in candy-colored invention and slapstick HQ chaos. The ride through memory, imagination, and abstract thought is playful spectacle with a surprisingly mature emotional core. It leaves you both lighter and more tender toward your own messy inner weather, a rare comfort that still thinks."
